paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/features_banner.png?t=1773407352\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you'll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple currencies/resources: Grow your gold, wood, iron and food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple characters: Automation now has a face and different skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: Plenty of options to boost your actions and automation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy: Different upgrades or characters affect the progress or power of other game elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enemy that fights back: Protect yourself from the dragon's roar, and fire attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has an ending: Feel the relief of saving your kingdom and ending the crisis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has a new beginning: Revisit the game with new modifiers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/steam_ss_1.png?t=1773407352\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s time for you to pack your gear and join the adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Some of the features listed above are still in development and may not be available in the demo version of the game.</i></p>","developers":["Cotovelo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/a463bf36b3f979cef38cd0bf7492c1e1bbe25d2e/he